{"v":4,"catch":"在 Cat Slide Tiles 中為小貓開闢道路！","desc":"Cat Slide Tiles 是一款 3D 益智遊戲，具有可愛和多彩的美感，讓小貓湯姆試圖清理乾淨回家的路。\n\n遊戲呈現了一個簡單的遊戲玩法：從地形上滑動塊以創建一條路徑，將小貓從 A 點帶到 B 點。\n\n每個場景都有三把鑰匙，小貓必須拿走所有鑰匙才能打開通往下一條路徑的門。 隨著您通過關卡，難度會逐漸增加。\n\n帶湯姆去他的目的地，他真的需要你在天黑前回家。\n\n特徵：\n- 玩過 80 個關卡；\n- 4種不同的環境；\n- 輕鬆直觀的遊戲玩法；\n- 一隻可愛的貓來幫忙；\n\n\n由 Minicactus Games 開發並由 QUByte Interactive 發行","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","策略","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f110b04f3c2990ac411b7b980a3c97d85be07f4bacbc53661548cfcb7c07c81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9f735b91abbabbab38ed5668a36f50a2a726c545b3fbd884e7751b5d854b616.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/855d93db60c8de49cd06411c201b5486419a4a833d39ce46453575dfe60fff5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ba9c8d02e9eb2854ca8e30df2bc764480d1a3a4297b2075e216148fd765db45.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f520e147d9493854fe36239130b0b0f602eac3fcd5832a688e4c32766b127f8e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6765f0228e7c5a4b3d268e85b76fefd31292d93dbecafca1a78f9ceec87bcf3e.jpg"],"titleId":"01001bf018b12000","dlc":[]}